; Multi-commodity transaction with @ unit price annotation. The buy debits
; 1 BTC into the crypto account at $50000/BTC and credits cash. This is the
; canonical ledger-cli "Buying foreign currency" example from the manual.

account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Crypto:BTC

P 2024-01-15 BTC $50000.00

2024-01-15 * Bought BTC
    Assets:Crypto:BTC                  1.00 BTC @ $50000.00
    Assets:Cash                      -$50000.00
